# Conv tests keep source and generate all results and vectors under /build/.
# Scoped guards also prevent accidentally checking in outputs written beneath
# a test directory through a custom output argument. Existing upstream inputs
# elsewhere in the repository are not covered by these rules.
/test/conv_*/**/results*/
/test/conv_*/**/evidence*/
/test/conv_*/**/development/
/test/conv_*/**/pre_optional_drain/
/test/conv_*/**/source_snapshot/
